From: Wilbolu <wilbolu@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 02:10:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add scheduler-owned HS admission to the release scheduler

Migrate the prior admission transaction plus cancelled-control drain, request identity rollback, slotted request state and shutdown propagation to c19e9c7d. Use the native indexed request lists, retire path, KV budget, row state, batched tracking allocation and deferred responses.
